  "body": "A machine owner asked not to have their name or GitHub handle used in the project. PR #4080 removes the attribution from the Doosan post header, the source comment in docs/evidence/614-dnm5700-sample.nc, and the historical #614/#616 entries in RECOMMENDED.md.\n\nThis issue records that existing request, as requested by the latest review of PR #4080. It does not request changes to post logic or NC instructions.\n\nDone means: the owner's attribution is replaced with \"a machine owner\" in those three files; the PR declares the recorded NC comment change under Goldens moved; the PR body and a commit carry this issue's closing reference.\n",
